  "prompt": "For each order line of the orders placed from 3 to 9 March 2025 whose product has a sister product, what was the sister product's list price on the order's date? order_ts holds UTC time: use its UTC date. A product's sister_product_id holds the product_id of its sister, and a list price is in effect from its version's valid_from to its valid_to, both days included (valid_to is missing for the current price). Return three columns, in this order: order_line_id, sister_name (the sister's product_name) and sister_price_eur. Return one row for each such order line whose sister product had a list price on that date. Any row order is fine.",
